  "details": "people join group instances, but they never read the rules, let's stop that.\n\nGroup Rules Shown Upon Entering\n\nmeaning that when someone joins the instance they are shown the rules of the group and they have to click on a button to remove the rules popup and enter the instance.\n\nHow to enable\n\nthis could be enabled as a first-time only or always pop-up (but if it pops up always every time you join an instance it may be annoying honestly)",
